  "info": {
    "description": "Username/password login issues a 15-minute JWT and a rotating refresh token. Logout revokes the session. Titles use 1–240 UTF-8 bytes after ASCII trimming. PATCH rejects null and requires at least one changed field. Responses use code/message/data; errors use code/message/details. Timestamps are epoch milliseconds. PostgreSQL and MySQL share business semantics.",
